# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game engine artefacts (Phase 8.3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled game artefacts are produced by the Lucky Riot game-engine repo and
# copied into these public paths at integration/build time. They must NEVER be
# committed to the website repo (no game source, no large binaries in git).
# Next.js copies public/ into out/ at build, so a locally-dropped artefact is
# still deployed. The tracked README/.gitkeep files below are the exceptions.
public/games/*/dev/game/**
!public/games/*/dev/game/.gitkeep
!public/games/*/dev/game/README.md
public/games/*/play/game/**
!public/games/*/play/game/.gitkeep
!public/games/*/play/game/README.md
public/customer/games/*/play/game/**
!public/customer/games/*/play/game/.gitkeep
!public/customer/games/*/play/game/README.md
